      "snippet": {
        "line": 400,
        "text": "theorem nativeIndex_gap (h : ℝ) (hh : 0 ≤ h) {n m : ℕ} (hn : 1 ≤ n) (hm : 1 ≤ m) (hnm : n ≤ m + 4) (hmn : m ≤ n + 4) : nativeIndex h n ≤ nativeIndex h m + nativeGap h ∧ nativeIndex h m ≤ nativeIndex h n + nativeGap h"
